Package: forestData
Title: Tools for Importing Canadian Forestry Data
Version: 0.1.1
Date: 2026-01-08
Authors@R: 
    person("Alex M", "Chubaty", , "achubaty@for-cast.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7146-8135"))
Description: Simplify importing of Canadian forestry data from various
    sources, including Common Attribute Schema for Forest Resource
    Inventories (CASFRI; <https://casfri.github.io/CASFRI/>), National
    Terrestrial Ecosystem Monitoring System (NTEMS;
    <https://opendata.nfis.org/mapserver/nfis-change_eng.html>), National
    Ecosystem Framework for Canada
    (<https://sis.agr.gc.ca/cansis/nsdb/ecostrat/gis_data.html>), and
    others.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
